WEBVTT

00:00:30.193 --> 00:00:32.570
Second thing that happened

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.864
was every time I was at home in Senegal,

00:00:34.864 --> 00:00:37.241
I wanted to talk to my friends in Paris.

00:00:38.117 --> 00:00:42.080
So my dad got tired
of the long-distance bills,

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:44.165
so he put a little lock on the phone --

00:00:44.165 --> 00:00:45.166
the rotary phone.

00:00:45.708 --> 00:00:47.126
I said, OK, no problem,

00:00:47.126 --> 00:00:48.252
hacked it,

00:00:48.252 --> 00:00:49.921
and he kept getting the bills.

00:00:49.962 --> 00:00:52.548
Sorry again, Dad,
if you’re watching this someday.

00:00:52.924 --> 00:00:56.886
And then, obviously,
the internet was also emerging.

00:00:57.220 --> 00:01:00.723
So what really happened
was that, in terms of technology,